{
  "id": "navigation_bar",
  "name": "Navigation Bar",
  "category": "navigation",
  "description": "Navigation container for bars, rails and sidebars: selectable items with labels, groups, collapsibles, dividers, slots and arrow-key roving.",
  "tier": "component",
  "install": "flutter_shadcn add navigation_bar",
  "import": "import 'package:<your_app>/ui/shadcn/navigation_bar/navigation_bar.dart';",
  "tags": [
    "navigation",
    "bar",
    "rail",
    "sidebar",
    "menu",
    "tabs"
  ],
  "deps": {
    "foundation": [
      "data",
      "platform"
    ],
    "theme": [
      "color_tokens",
      "theme"
    ],
    "primitives": [
      "navigation",
      "roving_group"
    ],
    "components": [
      "overflow_marquee",
      "tooltip"
    ]
  },
  "files": [
    "navigation_bar.dart",
    "navigation_bar_style.dart",
    "navigation_bar_theme.dart",
    "preview.dart"
  ],
  "api": {
    "classes": [
      "NavigationBar",
      "NavigationItem",
      "NavigationCollapsible",
      "NavigationGroup",
      "NavigationLabel",
      "NavigationDivider",
      "NavigationGap",
      "NavigationSlot",
      "NavigationItemRow",
      "NavigationBarTheme",
      "NavigationItemStyle"
    ],
    "enums": [
      "NavigationContainerType",
      "NavigationLabelType",
      "NavigationLabelPosition",
      "NavigationLabelSize",
      "NavigationOverflow"
    ],
    "constants": [
      "navigationBarDefaults",
      "navigationItemDefaults",
      "navigationActiveItemDefaults",
      "navigationBarThemeOverrides"
    ]
  },
  "theme": {
    "class": "NavigationBarTheme",
    "userFile": "navigation_bar_theme.dart",
    "defaults": "navigationBarDefaults",
    "fields": {
      "backgroundColor": "ThemedColor? - container fill; bar/rail default to background",
      "alignment": "MainAxisAlignment? - bar distribution",
      "direction": "Axis? - null resolves from the container type",
      "spacing": "double? - space between items, 8",
      "labelType": "NavigationLabelType? - sidebar defaults to expanded",
      "labelPosition": "NavigationLabelPosition? - bottom",
      "labelSize": "NavigationLabelSize? - small",
      "padding": "EdgeInsetsGeometry? - 12x8",
      "itemStyle": "NavigationItemStyle? - unselected item slice",
      "activeItemStyle": "NavigationItemStyle? - selected item slice"
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "`NavigationRail` and `NavigationSidebar` are `NavigationBar(container: ...)`; `NavigationButton` is `NavigationItem(onPressed:)`.",
    "`NavigationWidget`, the key-based selection API, surface blur and the size-keeping flags are dropped (clean break); `NavigationGap` and `NavigationSlot` are kept.",
    "Arrow-key roving uses `primitives/roving_group.dart`; the styled row, item widgets and their theme slice live in `primitives/navigation`."
  ]
}
